  "goodToKnow": "Der Paradigmenwechsel is a paradigm shift, a fundamental change in thinking. The term comes from Thomas Kuhn's 1962 book on scientific revolutions; examples include the shift from the Earth-centred to the Sun-centred universe. In German politics and business it's a popular buzzword. Das Paradigma (plural Paradigmen) is a model. The plural is the same."
